.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*

# Local SQLite database (Phase 3B backend). Never commit real business or
# customer data, even in development. See README for how to seed a fresh
# copy from the data files.
prisma/dev.db
prisma/dev.db-journal
prisma/dev.db-shm
prisma/dev.db-wal

# Real uploaded vehicle photos (Phase 3C, /admin/fleet/[id]), served by
# app/uploads/[...path]/route.js rather than Next's public/ folder (see
# that file's top comment for why). Actual business images, not source
# code, a production deployment should point this at real object storage
# instead of local disk. Never commit these.
uploads/*
!uploads/.gitkeep
